{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10641050","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10641050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1064105001:1":{"text":"...여기까지가 아탈리아 님께서 엔사 마을에 강림하셨던 이야기랍니다.","source_cn":"……讲到这里，阿塔利娅大人降临我们恩莎村的故事就结束了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9262610883522F82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064105002:1":{"text":"아탈리아 님은... 정말 선하고 위대한 반신이시군요...","source_cn":"阿塔利娅大人真是一位又善良又厉害的半神呀……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF553F78994A90EF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064105003:1":{"text":"아, 루이자 할머니! 아이다 수녀님은요? 지금 마을에 안 계신 것 같던데.","source_cn":"对了，路易莎奶奶，艾达修女后来去哪了？她好像不在我们村子里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7091A347CA331DA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064105004:1":{"text":"아이다 수녀님은... 아탈리아 님이 이끄는 심판자가 되었지요. 아탈리아 님께서 가장 신뢰하는 “기준점”이 되어 지금까지도 활약하고 계시답니다.","source_cn":"艾达修女呀……她加入了阿塔利娅大人治下的执刃修女团，作...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x601B6070BD9BB693","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064105005:1":{"text":"얼마 전에도 편지가 왔는데, 글쎄 아탈리아 님을 도와 악당들의 음모를 저지했다고 하더군요.","source_cn":"前段时间她还有写信回来，说她们协助阿塔利娅大人破坏了一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CEC670D8B81B1FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064105006:1":{"text":"우와, 대단하다! 루이자 할머니, 그 이야기도 들려주세요!","source_cn":"哇！好厉害！路易莎奶奶可以给我讲这个故事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF76C013DA5B0E865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064105007:1":{"text":"물론이지요. 하지만 지금은 집에 돌아가야 한답니다, 보세요, 아버지가 데리러 오셨네요.","source_cn":"当然可以。不过现在，你得回家了，你爸爸已经来接你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD59D10F67B8C8DB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064105008:0":{"text":"안나, 집에 갈 시간이야. 루이자 할머니도 쉬셔야지.","source_cn":"小安娜，该回家了，不要总是给路易莎奶奶添麻烦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9648513DC09645E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064105009:0":{"text":"하하, 괜찮답니다. 안나는 아주 말을 잘 들으니까요.","source_cn":"呵呵，没这回事。小安娜一向很听话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35356445C1E5DCCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064105010:1":{"text":"맞아요, 저 정말 착하다고요!","source_cn":"就是就是，我可乖了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F2FEFEDCDDE4970","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064105011:1":{"text":"그렇다면 다행이고.","source_cn":"那就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDE308544F46A773","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064105012:1":{"text":"자, 집에 가기 전에 해야 할 일이 있었지?","source_cn":"好了，回家之前还有一件事要做，是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFF4EB914CB52A33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064105013:1":{"text":"...듀라 여신님께 기도드리는 거요! 할머니께서 하신 말씀은 하나도 빼놓지 않고 기억하고 있어요!","source_cn":"——向艾雅女神祈祷！奶奶说的每句话我都记得很清楚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B6CF3A5E6EB357F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064105014:1":{"text":"루이자 할머니, 아빠랑 성당에 가서 기도하고 갈게요. 안녕히 계세요!","source_cn":"路易莎奶奶，我和爸爸去教堂里祷告了，再见！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE02D616327F88381","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064105015:1":{"text":"잘 가요, 귀여운 안나.","source_cn":"再见，可爱的小安娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7201004B20736E07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064105016:1":{"text":"듀라 님이시여, 당신의 자비와 보호에 감사드리며...","source_cn":"艾雅在上，感恩您的慈悲与庇佑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65CDA695A4BA01AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064105017:1":{"text":"...아미니 가족을 용서하시고 구원해 주신 것에도 감사드립니다...","source_cn":"……也感恩您对埃米妮一家的宽恕，与救赎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4AA6966D198AE78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修女路易莎":{"text":"수녀 루이자","source":"修女路易莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小安娜":{"text":"안나","source":"小安娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:吉拉科":{"text":"길라코","source":"吉拉科","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}}